=== wide characters take two cells
[echo 日本語日本語][] @0:19
[echo 日本語日][本語] @0:15
[😀][😀] @0:4
=== combining marks take none
[ééé][] @0:5
[éé][é] @0:4
=== a wide prompt counts its cells too
[ab][] @0:9
=== wrapping: a wide character that does not fit goes to the next row
[abcdefg][] @0:9
[abcdefgh][] @1:0
[abcdefg日][] @1:2
[abcdefg][日] @0:9
[abcdef日][] @1:0
[日本語日][本語日本語] @1:0
=== the redraw moves up exactly the rows it went down
[abcdef][g日] @0:8
$ \r\e[J$ a\r\e[3C\r\e[J$ ab\r\e[4C\r\e[J$ abc\r\e[5C\r\e[J$ abcd\r\e[6C\r\e[J$ abcde\r\e[7C\r\e[J$ abcdef\r\e[8C\r\e[J$ abcdefg\r\e[9C\r\e[J$ abcdefg日\r\e[2C\e[1A\r\e[J$ abcdefg日\r\e[1A\e[9C\r\e[J$ abcdefg日\r\e[1A\e[8C
